                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Really good food. Had the pork okonomiyaki and chicken karaage. Excellent meal. Wait time 15 minutes because everything is fresh cooked. Okonomiyaki was better than the one I had in Osaka. Karaage chicken was perfect chicken pieces cut and battered. Definitely a great place to visit if you’re after a little Japan in Taiwan looking over the river.",
