                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "【Hot Okonomiyaki | Dadaocheng Wharf】 I had delicious okonomiyaki at the Dadaocheng Container Market! The seasoning and portion size were just right, and at $170 a serving, it was a good deal. The service was excellent, and they accepted credit cards and Line Pay, making for a pleasant and convenient dining experience.\n\n*If you don\u0027t eat meat, you can inform the owner beforehand to order meatless – thoughtful and friendly!\n\nThe atmosphere was relaxed, with upstairs seating and alcohol sales, making it suitable for gatherings with friends.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "【炎炎大阪燒｜大稻埕碼頭】\n在大稻埕貨櫃市集吃到美味的大阪炒麵！調味剛好、份量剛好，一份$170表現不錯。服務態度好，支援刷卡、Line Pay，吃得開心又方便～\n\n＊不吃肉也可以事先告知老闆客製不加肉，貼心又友善！\n\n現場氣氛輕鬆，有樓上座位區可用餐，也有販售酒類，適合朋友聚餐小酌。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
